{"id":"n56097-2-5","stage":4,"title":"낚다 · 引诱","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56097-2-5-1","ko":"너 컴퓨터 싸게 샀다며?","zh":"你不是说电脑买得很便宜吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"컴퓨터","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}},{"text":"싸게","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸게","audio":"/audio/757f0ca81cb8861ca254.mp3"}},{"text":"샀다며?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀다며","audio":"/audio/84d6305a616d34ad8fc1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사